# 10.6 Static Information Dashboard Design: gt and gtExtras methods

::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
product %>%
  gt::gt() %>%
  gt_plt_bullet(column = current, target = target, width = 60, palette = c("lightblue", "black")) %>%
  gt_theme_538()
```

